		{"id":"0d921b57fa1d8eac","type":"text","text":"**Treat as standard user**\n(Equipment options dictated by user criteria)","x":-762,"y":196,"width":401,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"2950a72f37002df7","type":"text","text":"Is form operator a procurement agent?","x":-686,"y":-484,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7527232f983d3437","type":"text","text":"# Self Service Portal","x":-1240,"y":-484,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"9d4d8202dbc35886","type":"text","text":"# Existing Incident","x":-1240,"y":-300,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"8492eb3251bfceb9","type":"text","text":"# RITM Submitted","x":-300,"y":400,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d5b276f49ed99b62","type":"text","text":"Agent sets \"Fulfillment action\" on each line item","x":-300,"y":520,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"5544b052e510cddb","type":"text","text":"# Provision Hardware\n\n**Conditions**\n1. MRVS lines where action is \"Replace\" or \"Order\" >= 1\n2. RITM doesn't already have any POs related to it\n3. Approval is not requested\n4. Item is included in sys_property 'procurement_catalog_items'\n\n**Outcome**\n1. MRVS rows where action is \"Replace\" or \"Order\" are grouped into an object array\n2. Inventory is checked against the models of each object\n3. Approval is requested against the RITM\n4. For each model in stock, create an SCTASK to distribute assets from stock.\n5. For each model not in stock, create a PO for each unique vendor servicing those models.","x":-50,"y":640,"width":501,"height":620},
		{"id":"6a64c0c895e1016c","type":"text","text":"# Generate Incident\n\n**Conditions**\n1. Parent type is not INC\n2. MRVS lines where action is \"fix\" >= 1\n3. Assignment group is not empty\n\n**Outcome**\n\nAn INC record assigned to the assignment group of the parent RITM, a reference to the RITM, caller derived from requested for, a list of items to fix, and the RITM's justification value.","x":-801,"y":640,"width":501,"height":620},
		{"id":"43c0533b6d0a577b","type":"text","text":"Inventory check","x":76,"y":1360,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"686666300bb6094c","type":"text","text":"Approval","x":76,"y":1480,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ca63468938a76717","type":"text","text":"SCTASK: Distribute from stock","x":-174,"y":1600,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"7de4b18d8b0f7881","type":"text","text":"Purchase Order(s)","x":326,"y":1600,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"e530abb2bca2b751","type":"text","text":"Technician arranges repair, shipping if needed","x":-801,"y":1600,"width":501,"height":60},
		{"id":"94a298c9b4221b20","type":"text","text":"Ordering for stock?","x":-300,"y":-300,"width":250,"height":60},
